  "mcpName": "com.je4ndev.elozi/mcp",
  "description": "Connect MCP desktop agents (Claude, Cursor, Codex) to Elozi customer service: read authorized conversations, draft or send replies and hand over to humans with a scoped, revocable agent token.",
